# Claude Deck keeps its runtime data (prefs, token, chats, trash) in %LOCALAPPDATA%\ClaudeDeck,
# outside the repo, so there's nothing app-specific to ignore here. This covers local clutter.

# Claude Code: the SHARED agent configuration is committed on purpose. The Stop hook and the
# permission rules in .claude/ are how this repo's rules are enforced rather than merely stated,
# and a rule that lives on one machine binds nobody. Only the machine-specific pieces are ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.lock
.claude/scheduled_tasks*

# Personal Claude Code notes for this repo (account, auth, local workflow); see CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Impeccable (the design skill): its product record, design record, surface brief and detector
# config are committed; its working files (screenshots, decision pages, hook cache) stay local.
.impeccable/review/
.impeccable/questions/
.impeccable/mocks/
.impeccable/build/
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/config.local.json

# Dependencies (there are none, but npm creates this if someone runs npm install)
node_modules/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Local environment files
.env
.env.*

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
